hord","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rolled into it, would start before time zero, so everything then moves later by a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Work\/Rendering\/LeadIn-swift.enum","type":"reference"},{"text":": in a beat work the pickup grows by that much, or one is created (a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pickup reaching a full bar adds a bar).","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then each fermata — on a note, over a span in a part mark — holds every part: the holds"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of all parts starting at one moment become the longest of them, as do the pauses (after a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fermata, or at a caesura) at one moment. A hold comes from the fermata’s execution, else","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the rules for its shape, else the built-in stretch for its shape; a fermata that isn’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"played holds nothing. ","type":"text"},{"code":"options.fermataMode","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" says how the holds become time (see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/RenderingOptions\/FermataMode-swift.enum","type":"reference"},{"text":"); a wall work, which has no tempo map, inserts it. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fermatas and caesuras are then removed; ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Work\/Rendering\/fermataTimes","type":"reference"},{"text":" keeps where each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fermata now starts.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The result is the same kind of content, keeps everything else — maps, pedals, tables,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rules — and is unlocked."}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Work\/Error","isActive":true},{"text":" if the lead-in can’t be applied.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Throws"}]}],"references":{"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel","abstract":[{"text":"A representation-agnostic musical composition model.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormodel","title":"IvorModel","role":"collection"},"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel/Work":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Work","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A musical work containing parts and associated data."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Work","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Work","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormodel\/work","title":"Work"},"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel/Work/Error":{"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Error"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Work\/Error","title":"Work.Error","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"An error thrown by ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Work"},{"text":" operations.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormodel\/work\/error","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Error"}]},"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel/RenderingOptions/FermataMode-swift.enum":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How rendering turns fermata holds and caesura pauses into time."}],"role":"symbol","n